    "body": "Quick pass (M5): the body is complete (what changed, the open questions settled, verification: actionlint clean, YAML, `gate release --no-snapshots --dry-run`, the xtask pin and clippy; not exercised: a real run, which is the maintainer's post-merge check; `Changelog: none`; `Fixes #1413`). #1413 is P4 (not paused). PROCESS_VERSION 55. The quick gate is green apart from a red that also fails on clean main (filed as #1417).\n\nRunner prep (outside the repo): the Linux self-hosted runner this workflow targets is registered and online. The packages the new AGENTS.md section lists (git, gh, pkg-config, libwayland-dev, libxkbcommon-dev, libx11-dev, xvfb, mesa-vulkan-drivers, libgl1-mesa-dri) are installed, along with sccache and the Rust toolchain on the service PATH. Still the maintainer's to do: allow `github-actions[bot]` to push `v*.*.0` tags if a tag rule blocks it.\n\nFlagged ready; a review by the other session is next. A `.github` change is expected to land as `needs-maintainer`.",
