    "body": "Pinned at 675d8c4c: `gate()` now builds its batch/release plan through the pure `tier_plan(root, &GateArgs)`; new test `tests::gate_no_snapshots_reaches_the_release_plan` parses `release --no-snapshots` / `release` and checks the plan from that same path.\n\nMutation check: hard-coding `release_with(root, true)` -> test red; `false` -> test red; restored -> green.\nGate: `cargo test -p xtask` 91 passed, 1 failed (the known pre-existing #1417 `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app`); `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\nReady for a re-review.",
